From 8747531aa9484268ade265b174342fe945bbec00 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReSourceX Assistant <assistant@example.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 10:56:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add notifications, request messaging, resource history,
 impact, org verification, tests and CI

Features
- Notification API (list, unread count, mark read) and a bell UI on every signed-in page
- Messaging linked to donation requests (participants only, closed when declined) with a chat window
- Resource history (passport) for donations and exchanges
- Impact summary endpoint for completed donations and exchanges
- Profile editing and administrator organisation verification with an audit record

Fixes
- Phase 5 migration: set exchanges.status default to PROPOSED (inserts failed on upgraded databases)
- Reject tokens of deleted accounts; prevent admin self-delete; 409 instead of 500 when deleting
  a resource with exchange history
- Replace the fake forgot-password form with an honest message

Quality
- 21 integration tests (PostgreSQL) incl. concurrency; GitHub Actions CI
- docs/FINAL_REVIEW.md with requirements, test evidence, demo script
